{"id":56,"name":"mankey","speciesId":56,"dex":56,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["fighting"],"stats":{"hp":40,"attack":80,"defense":35,"special-attack":35,"special-defense":45,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"vital-spirit","hidden":false},{"name":"anger-point","hidden":false},{"name":"defiant","hidden":true}],"height":5,"weight":280,"baseExp":61,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/56.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/56.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/56.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/56.ogg","genus":"Pig Monkey Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant."},{"version":"yellow","text":"An agile POKéMON that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason."},{"version":"silver","text":"It's unsafe to ap­ proach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can't distinguish friends from foes."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness."},{"version":"ruby","text":"When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"version":"emerald","text":"When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee."},{"version":"firered","text":"Light and agile on its feet, and ferocious in temperament. When angered, it flies into an uncontrollable frenzy."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"version":"sun","text":"It can spontaneously become enraged. Everyone near it clears out as it rampages, and the resulting loneliness makes it angrier still."},{"version":"moon","text":"Its raging tires it out and causes it to fall asleep, but the anger resonating in its dreams causes it to wake up—which infuriates it all over again."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"The smallest of things could cause it to lose its temper. Because it doesn’t hold in its stress, this Pokémon can live a long time."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":190,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"mankey","speciesId":56,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28"],"species":"primeape","speciesId":57,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Usar golpe específico 20 vezes"],"species":"annihilape","speciesId":979,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":56,"name":"mankey","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/56.png"}],"games":[1,2,3,4,5